    <string name="explain_title">What is the difference?</string>
    <string name="explain_body">Charging off makes the phone run from its battery: the level drops and heat rises. Pass-through feeds the charger straight to the phone and leaves the battery idle — no charge, no drain. Result: less heat and less wear during gaming or long sessions.</string>

